[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Linux Disk Info
Name[ru]=Linux Disk Info
GenericName=Drive Health Monitor
GenericName[ru]=Монитор здоровья дисков
Comment=SMART, temperature, wear and live I/O for Linux drives
Comment[ru]=SMART, температура, износ и живой I/O дисков Linux
